<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">For the convenience of readers,
amounts in Renminbi, the Chinese currency (&#8220;CNY&#8221;), have been translated into United States dollars (&#8220;US$&#8221;) at
the applicable rate of US$1.00 = CNY7.2673 as quoted by www.ofx.com as of June 30, 2024, except as otherwise disclosed. No representation
is made that the CNY amounts could have been, or could be, converted into US$ at that rate, or at all.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

