<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 24pt; text-align: justify">The reconciliation from loss for the year
from continuing operations to net loss is as follows:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 24pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-01-012023-12-31" escape="true" id="Fact001834" name="chnr:ReconciliationOfOperatingProfitLossFromSegmentsConsolidatedTextBlock"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="xdx_894_ecustom--ReconciliationOfOperatingProfitLossFromSegmentsConsolidatedTextBlock_pn3n3_z287oveP4YA8" summary="xdx: Disclosure - SEGMENT INFORMATION (Details 1)" style="font: 11pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; float: right; border-collapse: collapse; width: 98%">
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: White">
