<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 20pt; text-align: justify">The calculations of basic and diluted earnings
per share from discontinued operations are based on:</p>

<p style="font: 10.5pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 20pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

