with Feishang Enterprise. Pursuant to the agreement, Feishang Management shares 40 square meters of office premises for 33 months. Feishang
Management signed a new contract with Feishang Enterprise in October 2023, which will expire on September 30, 2024.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr></table>

