<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 9pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 28.35pt; text-align: justify">* Anka Capital and Anka are each jointly
owned by Wong Wah On Edward and Tam Cheuk Ho, who are officers of the Company.</p>

<p style="font: 8pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 24.55pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 9pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 28.35pt; text-align: justify">**Feishang Enterprise and Feishang
Group are controlled by Mr.&#160;Li Feilie, who is the controlling shareholder of the Company.</p>

